Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"769361c7-62ca-574c-939d-7ea70923f058"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"3465ac97-8f57-ca46-9a0a-b43fa75033f7"],

